  },
  "type": {
    "families": ["Nantes, Georgia, serif", "Graphik, Helvetica, sans-serif"],
    "scale": ["0.75rem", "0.875rem", "1rem", "1.125rem", "1.375rem", "1.875rem", "2.375rem", "3.25rem", "4.5rem"],
    "weights": [200, 400, 500],
    "leading": [1.23, 1.32, 1.43, 1.44, 1.5],
    "tracking": ["0.15px"],
    "roles": {
      "display": "3.25rem / 4rem, serif, 400",
      "section-title": "1.875rem / 2.375rem, serif, 400",
      "body": "1rem / 1.5rem, sans, 400",
      "meta": "0.875rem / 1.25rem, sans, 200, #757575",
      "micro": "0.75rem / 1rem, sans, 400"
    }
  },
  "space": {
    "base": "4px",
    "scale": ["4px", "8px", "12px", "16px", "20px", "24px", "32px", "40px", "48px", "56px", "68px"]
  },
  "radius": ["4px", "20px", "40px", "999px"],
  "shadow": [
    "0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)",
    "0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)",
    "0 7px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)"
  ],
  "motion": {
    "durations": ["100ms", "200ms", "252ms", "500ms", "800ms", "1200ms", "5000ms"],
    "easings": [
      "cubic-bezier(0.17, 0.67, 0.24, 1)",
      "cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)",
      "cubic-bezier(0.33, 1, 0.68, 1)",
      "ease-in-out"
    ],
    "triggers": ["load", "in-view", "hover"],
    "techniques": [
      "timed-word-rotator",
      "in-view-decode-fade",
      "surface-tint-hover",
      "ambient-hero-video",
      "diagonal-legibility-scrim"
    ],
    "scroll_effects": [
      { "name": "in-view-decode-fade", "property": "opacity", "trigger": "in-view", "safety": "production-safe" },
      { "name": "hero-scrim-fade", "property": "opacity", "trigger": "in-view", "safety": "production-safe" }
    ],
    "stack": ["IntersectionObserver", "CSS transitions", "CSS @keyframes"],
    "reduced_motion": "not-respected"
  },
  "notes": "Grounded in raw/faire.json + raw/faire.css + the desktop/mobile/frame captures. The site ships ~443 custom properties under a `slate-*` namespace; collapsed here into roles. Three tiers are preserved deliberately: neutral UI (`action-*`), brand voice (`expressive-*`, band grounds only), and named programs (`program-*`, badges only) — that separation is the transferable part. `craft.theme.supportsDark: true` is a FALSE POSITIVE — the probe's 'dark' sample (bg transparent, fg #000, same white surfaces) is the light palette re-read; the site does not re-theme, so `color.dark` is omitted. The profile lists the closing headline's five nouns as `transform/parallax` on `scroll-progress`; the frames show a fixed slot with a changing word, so it is normalized to a timed `load` rotator (stagger_delays 500-2500ms inside a ~5s cycle, `fadeInOut` keyframe). 25000ms duration dropped (vendor toast/consent). Line-heights were authored in px (24/20/64) and are recorded here as the equivalent ratios. `letter-spacing: 0.15px` is the only tracking value on the page and is kept verbatim rather than converted to an em ramp."
}
